Jo/view) | Fully revised, production-ready Business Requirements Document (BRD) with all 17 fixes. |\n| **`brd.md`** | `text/markdown` | [brd.md](https://drive.google.com/file/d/130s-KII6oDYu5oTvHoIbGvvSCGFMbuK5/view) | Original baseline BRD snapshot. |\n\n---\n\n### Google Docs in the Same Folder:\n* 📝 **[HR Agentic Solution BRD - With Tracked Changes](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tHkqwbPOJ2HUlmTliaR-Ip0gnpAhxiIrXKcJxu0qlT4/edit)**\n* 📄 **[HR Agentic Solution BRD (MVP 1 - Revised & Approved)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1gW-lwRWN1sltc0jUolYhFktNlzJ3App5d7z4AkivZlI/edit)**\n* 💬 **[HR Agentic Solution BRD - Reviewed & Annotated](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MwYH70ssudg0-_SjPjZQndfjtsD0ca616YYNB0NgS5g/edit)**\n* 📋 **[HR Agentic Solution - Agile User Stories (MVP 1)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1NxDvYnWwoIs2JUpIntrHt8tfHQiQNfy4DEwHGqMQH6U/edit)**\n* 🚀 **[HR Agentic Solution - Functional Specs & User Stories (MVP 1)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/190GK62Mq6ogskpDSTs55Ff4OqBmLzD3-JoEzreiIUqQ/edit)**\n* 📊 **[HR Agentic Solution - Architecture & Workflow Diagrams (MVP 1)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1nrm5wgf8b-Z0TUlzQG5WK6MIz427TjdzW-l4th_676g/edit)**"}
