{"step_index":254,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-17T14:50:48Z","content":"The **System Design Document (`design.md`)** has been created and synced across your local workspace, session artifacts, and Google Drive:\n\n* 📄 **Markdown File (Direct Local Artifact):** [design.md](file:///usr/local/google/home/gauravrawat/.gemini/jetski/brain/ca4322d4-9341-4bd7-ad62-33640faaced0/design.md)\n* 📁 **Workspace Copy:** [design.md](file:///google/src/cloud/gauravrawat/summarize_latest_chats/google3/hr_agentic_solution/design.md)\n* 🔗 **Google Docs Link:** [HR Agentic Solution - System Design Document (MVP 1)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ERz1GjU6SybbiuYe05zV-9387A2Jx97sNzBwttVOHcY/edit)\n* 📂 **Google Drive Project Folder:** [HR Agentic Solution - Project Artifacts](https://drive.google.com/corp/drive/folders/115mF5i6YL6YdECFDMdHJoO5gYTXVxEvl)\n\n---\n\n### Key System Design Sections in `design.md`\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                                SYSTEM DESIGN ARCHITECTURE MATRIX                                │\n├───────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 1. Core Design Principles     │ • Zero-Trust Mock Identity Assertion (Signed JWT via Gateway)   │\n│                               │ • Deterministic State Mutation via Human-in-the-Loop (HITL)     │\n│                               │ • Forward SAGA Consistency with Dead-Letter Queue (DLQ)         │\n│                               │ • Defense-in-Depth Safety Guardrails (Input & Output Filtering) │\n├────────────────────────\n<truncated 4494 bytes>\n───────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n### Complete Project Deliverables Index in Google Drive:\n\n| Artifact Name | Type | Google Drive Direct Link | Local File Link |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **System Design Document** | Markdown / GDoc | [System Design (GDoc